  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### [3,2,0] (optional; all cells above and the driver run with `Λ = {3, 2, 0}`, 2026-10-11; main cells 58 s, driver 431 s, analysis ~15 s)\n\nSetup regression: 225 states, label rule and wavefunction monomial reproduced (< 1e-39.8 / 1e-44.2 / 1e-43.7), B gap 6.5e-6, eigen residual < 1e-52. Site-1 regression: K ranks 4, 9, 15, site-1 counts 11 (generic) and 9 (curve point (1, 559/280, 403/140)).\n- **Support of e1 (x) e_nu: 122 of 225 SoV states, all 15 site-1 labels, only 41 with x1 = (λ1|λ1 c1)**; K ranks per site-1 label {1,2,4,4,6,9,2,4,6,9,5,9,12,9,15}, per site-2 label {1,2,4,3,6,6,2,4,6,9,5,9,12,9,15}; rationalisation error 2.8e-77, denominators <= 11 digits; overlap identity 1e-40.7 / 1e-44.4 / 1e-43.8; **z-independence exact (True, True)**; naive weight rule fails (91 violating entries, 25 support pairs outside it).\n- **Counts: per-label automatic 54** (site-1: 11 generic / 9 reduced); block form: matrix ranks sum 30, 49 products (explicit 52; random covector 31 / 50). Column ranks up to 4 (13 non-automatic columns).\n- Loci: vacuum x1 column (3|32): conic constants **c'=0: 2(t+2)/(3(t+1))** (88/97 at t = 62/35, 59/66 at 29/15) and **c'=1: (t+2)/(2(t+1))** (66/97, 59/88) — the SAME function as the adjoint's, = cc1(1-t) (exact over 15 points, only match t' = 1 - t); 16 maximal column sets (single column (3|32),0: curve {923521 gB = 101753 gC^2, 961 gA = -97 gC}); the vacuum family b3 = alpha^2 and the adjoint-type quadric give no reduction (54); **b3 = 0: 43** (35 columns, 43 wedges, exact closed forms, verified on all 225 states at 3 fresh points: < 1e-42.7, 1e-43.3, 1e-43.2; exponent law with offsets 12 down to 8, a of degree <= 2 in sR; kernels exact rational functions of t over 15 points, poles at t in {0, 1, 2, -1, -2}). Dim-1 curves with rational points: counts **52-53** (CG-complete) and one non-reduced curve {(2450 gB + 3007 gC^2)^2 = 0, ...} with count **42** (NOT complete: 9 of 12 weights).\n- Reach: generic / vacuum family / quadric / the six CG-complete curves: 12 of 12 weights, rank 2 on the three double weights; **b3 = 0: 9 of 12 (rank 1 on the double weights): not complete**. Undo identity exact (True x 3), 10 HW states in 8 irreps.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
